@startuml
title SIC/XE Simulator - Execution State Machine

[*] --> Ready

Ready --> Running : run
Ready --> Stepping : step
Ready --> Ready : reset

Running --> Running : execute instruction
Running --> Halted : halt
Running --> Paused : breakpoint
Running --> WaitingInput : input required
Running --> Stopped : stop

Stepping --> Ready : step complete
Stepping --> Halted : instruction halts CPU

Paused --> Ready : resume
WaitingInput --> Running : input received
Stopped --> Ready : reset/resume policy

Halted --> Ready : reset

Ready --> Ready : unstep
Paused --> Ready : unstep

@enduml
